       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. NESTED-IF.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 APPLICANT-AGE PIC 99 VALUE 34.
       01 MONTHLY-INCOME PIC 9(6) VALUE 450000.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           IF APPLICANT-AGE >= 18 AND APPLICANT-AGE <= 60
               IF MONTHLY-INCOME >= 300000
                   DISPLAY "APPLICANT IS ELIGIBLE"
               ELSE
                   DISPLAY "INCOME IS TOO LOW"
               END-IF
           ELSE
               DISPLAY "AGE IS OUTSIDE THE ALLOWED RANGE"
           END-IF.
           STOP RUN.
